Taapo Se Hua Tukde Jab Tera Badan Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
ghurbat Pe Teri Roye Marqad Mein Hassan (as) Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
<br>
1. Zinda Na Palat Aana Maidaan Se Ay Beta.<br>
<br>
ruqsat Ke Waqt Tha Ye Maadar Ka Suqan Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
2. Dada Ki Shujaa'at Tum Duniya Ko Dikha Dena.<br>
<br>
seh Legi Teri Madar Har Ranjo Mehen Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
3. Qasim (as) Jo Chale Ran Ko Rokar Kaha Sarwar (as) Ne.<br>
<br>
qaliq Ki Qasam Tu Hai Tasveer E Hassan (as) Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
4. Lashe Ke Tere Tukde Chadar Mein Chadar Mein Jama Karke.<br>
<br>
haalat Pe Teri Roye Sultane Zaman Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
5. Kis Tarha Se Le Jaou'n Qaime Mein Tera Lasha.<br>
<br>
kehte The Shahe Waala Ay Tashna Dahan Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
6. Farwa (sa) Ne Kaha Rokar Yeh Lasha E Qasim (as) Par.<br>
<br>
mehendi Ka Rasam Karne Aayi Hai Behen Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
7. Guzre The Chand Lamhe Afsos Hui Bewa.<br>
<br>
kya Kehke Tujhe Roye Ghamqwar Dulhan Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
8. Kehti Thi Dulhan Rokar Naushah Ke Lashe Par.<br>
uljhi Hai Zara Dekho Kangan Mein Rasan Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
9. Beparda Rasan Basta Shabbir (as) Ki Duqtar Hai.<br>
maqtal Ki Zamee'n Par Hai Be Goro Kafan Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
10. Taa Hashr Kabhi Mazhar Aabad Na Phir Hoga.<br>
barbaad Hua Aise Zehra (sa) Ka Chaman Qasim (as)<br>
<br>
az: Shayer E Ahlebait Janab Mazhar Abidi Sahab